This parameter is required.', example='wiki_section_page_1_sec_1_rev_7'),
      kind: string(name='kind', description='Required. Always returned. The actual evidence object type. Constraints: {"enum":["raw","wiki_page","wiki_section","graph_fact"],"maxLength":64}.

This parameter is required.', example='wiki_section'),
      knowledgeBaseId: string(name='knowledgeBaseId', description='Required. Always returned. The opaque business ID generated by the server. Validates ownership and does not accept arbitrary paths. Constraints: {"minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,127}$"}.

